{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788387143625,"sessionID":"ses_f9bd1f9e7ffe9fbmbl05uGvnlZ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-bb6b08785975daa4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"gh issue view 152 --comments"},"output":"author:\tkantord\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nRound 1 couldn't pick a spelling (maintainer: \"cannot choose yet\"). Round 2 will present a concrete candidate built from the maintainer's own sketch (a separate compose note): hoisting match arms directly into the signature, dropping the parameter entirely, e.g. `fn render = Msg(Ping -> \"*ping*\" or Quit -> \"*quit*\" or Text -> .body)`. Tracked as function-signature-matching-syntax on the board, needs round 2.\n--\n","metadata":{"output":"author:\tkantord\nassociation:\towner\nedited:\tfalse\nstatus:\tnone\n--\nRound 1 couldn't pick a spelling (maintainer: \"cannot choose yet\"). Round 2 will present a concrete candidate built from the maintainer's own sketch (a separate compose note): hoisting match arms directly into the signature, dropping the parameter entirely, e.g. `fn render = Msg(Ping -> \"*ping*\" or Quit -> \"*quit*\" or Text -> .body)`. Tracked as function-signature-matching-syntax on the board, needs round 2.\n--\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"gh issue view 152 --comments","time":{"start":1788387143618,"end":1788387143623}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me read the comments on the issue. The issue view shows \"comments: 1\". Let me view the comments. I need to read every comment. Let me use gh issue view with --comments.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0642e2bee001Ufratkp1ZjRimr","sessionID":"ses_f9bd1f9e7ffe9fbmbl05uGvnlZ","messageID":"msg_0642e22a60014ramSFeBReg26S"}}
